	(text "VBUS is used to sense if USB is connected\nVBUS must not exceed VIO (which is VDD -> which is 3V3 from the internal LDO) +2.5V\nVoltage divider (5V * 47K5) / (22K1 + 47K5) = 3.4V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40.386 203.962 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "013ada90-ceeb-43ac-b15e-79ff8f003ad2")
	)
	(text "TO DO:\nFind suitable LED's REG / GREEN etc\nFix the MOSFET pinout\nFind suitable capacitors ( correct foot print and voltage rating )\nRe-Check schematic for correct values and symbos\nRe-Check and Re-Do PDN block diagram and check logic\nCheck the BMU thermistor and resustir values\nRe-evaluate the sleep/wake logic between RTC / ESP32 / BQ25892 QON pin\nCheck footrpints for all components\nRe-check pinouts from ESP32 (hibernat was not capable of hardware interupt)\nRe-check USB-PD Vmin and Vmax options"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.152 -30.226 0)
		(effects
